(Preah Sihanouk): The Preah Sihanouk Provincial Administration on September 5, 2022 issued a notification on the date and place of the examination for candidates to be included in the Ministry of Interior Prison Officers for 2022, which took place on September 9, 2022. October 2022 at the examination center of Hun Sen Krong Primary School.
