(Phnom Penh): Mr. Ith Sam Heng, Minister of Labor and Vocational Training, expressed his support for the establishment of the Cambodian Bag, Shoes and Electronics Association.
This support was made on the occasion of the 17 leaders of the Cambodian Bags, Shoes and Electronics Association to pay a courtesy call and request for advice from the Minister on the morning of October 5, 2022.
On that occasion, Mr. Ith Sam Heng supported the members of the association who united to establish this association in accordance with the law, statutes and freedoms of professional organizations and become a professional structure in Cambodia. This is a good start to understand and protect the interests of both its members and the interests of workers.
The Minister outlined some of the new developments that the Ministry of Labor and Vocational Training has achieved, including setting the minimum wage for workers for 2023 and introducing a pension system for those under the law. On employment.
