The benefits that the members of the project get is the support to order products from their factories from well-known overseas buyers. On the other hand, if the members of the association need the Ministry to advise on laws and regulations, the Ministry will be happy to help.
(Phnom Penh): Samdech Akka Moha Ponhea Chakrei Heng Samrin, President of the National Assembly of Cambodia, said that Cuba is a good friend of Cambodia, as the two countries have a good relationship and cooperation with each other for a long time.
The remarks of Samdech Akka Moha Ponhea Chakrei Heng Samrin were made this morning, Wednesday, October 5, 2022, on the occasion that Samdech allowed His Excellency Manuel Marero Cruz, Prime Minister of the Republic of Cuba and his delegation to pay a courtesy call on When he led a delegation to pay an official and friendly visit to Cambodia.
Samdech considers the presence of the Prime Minister of Cuba at this time as a further contribution to accelerate the existing good cooperation to a better level in line with the current regional and global context. Quickly.
At the same time, Samdech asked the Prime Minister to help promote and increase cooperation in trade, economy and investment between the two countries, which is still limited to better development.
On that occasion, Mr. Manuel Marro Cruz expressed his deep gratitude to the President of the National Assembly for honoring His Excellency and the delegation to pay a courtesy call on this occasion. He said that he followed the heroism of the President of the National Assembly who participated in the liberation and development of the country forever.
The Kingdom of Cambodia and the Republic of Cuba have had good relations and cooperation for a long time. 2022 marks the 62nd anniversary of the two countries' long-standing friendship.
Samdech Akka Moha Ponhea Chakrei Heng Samrin emphasized that Cuba is a good friend of Cambodia and always supports Cambodia in all circumstances. In fact, when Cambodia was just liberated from the genocidal regime of Pol Pot on January 7, 1979, the Cuban friend provided emergency social, health and educational assistance that met the basic needs of the Cambodian people in times of need, in accordance with the Khmer proverb "Good friends help each other". In times of need. ”
Samdech would like to support and appreciate the brilliant results of the visit of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia to the Republic of Cuba last week to further strengthen the friendship, solidarity and cooperation between the two countries. Benefits to both nations.
Samdech Akka Moha Ponhea Chakrei Heng Samrin accepted the invitation of the President of the National Assembly of Cuba and promised to lead a high-level delegation of the National Assembly of Cambodia to pay an official and friendly visit to Cuba at an appropriate time.
