Donation to the affected people now for the average affected family of 504 families, each family received: 25 kg of rice, 10 cans of fish, 1 can of fish sauce, 1 box of noodles and 50,000 Riels. As for the 9 severely affected families, each family received: 50 kg of rice, 2 boxes of noodles, 20 cans of fish, 2 sticks of fish sauce, 100 sheets of zinc and a budget of 2 million riels.
