(Phnom Penh): In the dissemination and consultation forum of Phnom Penh Capital Council this morning, October 4, 2022, at Wat Chhouk Va in Sangkat Kork Roka, Khan Prek Pnov, local residents in Khan Prek Pnov asked the authorities to help solve the request. Many, especially to help build infrastructure in their locality.
The forum was held in the presence of Mr. Mop Sarin, Chairman of the Phnom Penh Municipal Council, Mr. Huot Hay, Deputy Governor of Phnom Penh, representing Mr. Khuong Sreng, Governor of Phnom Penh and Mr. Ros Sophan, Chairman of the Prek Pnov Assistance Team.
