The outreach and consultation forum of Phnom Penh Capital Council is held once a year to address all concerns, suggestions and requests of the people. But for the second year in a row, it was missed by the Kovid-19 pandemic. However, the Phnom Penh authorities continue to address the concerns of the people.
Mr. HUOT HAY stated that in order to participate in the comments and raise questions and requests of the people in the forum and consultation of the Phnom Penh Capital Council this morning, October 4, there are a number of oral questions and requests. 19 people equal to 32 issues and 76 questions in the mailbox.
