(Siem Reap): The Ministry of Environment held the 24th meeting of the Board of Directors of the ASEAN Biodiversity Center (ACB) for two days from October 3 to 4, 2022 to discuss and decide on some agendas.
The meeting was chaired by Ms. Chan Somaly, Undersecretary of State, Ministry of Environment, with the participation of delegations from 10 ASEAN countries, project implementing partners and stakeholders through a total of more than one live and online meeting. 70 people at Sokhalay Hotel, Siem Reap.
The purpose of this meeting is to review, discuss and decide on the first: activities and results of the ACB for 2021-2022, second: the budget report for 2021-2022 and the proposal for 2023 and 3) cooperation with Partners for ASEAN Biodiversity Jobs.
This meeting to review and discuss the documents of the following agenda:
