Samdech Techo Hun Sen encouraged: "And also tell the group that do not pay the bank or do not pay the microfinance is a sign of confiscation, I encourage the confiscation, because it is your party to borrow money. "They have the right contract. Now you want to make a revolution from there. Talk to each other honestly. I warned once and quietly, but now they are whispering and the target is whispering.
