Key remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen on the occasion of handing out diplomas to nearly 4,000 students of Vanda Institute
(Phnom Penh): On Monday morning, October 3, 2022, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, presented diplomas to 3,866 students of Vanda Institute, 3,382 females. Students who receive this degree include associate degree, bachelor's degree, master's degree and doctoral degree.
On that occasion, Samdech Techo Hun Sen delivered a speech for about 1 hour and 30 minutes, the following are the main contents of Samdech Techo Hun Sen:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen commends the management team of Vanda Institute for overcoming the difficulties of the Kovid 19 epidemic in providing knowledge and sustaining education.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the quality of online education is still good if there is attention.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that so far the people clearly understand the measures that the Royal Government has put in place during the 19 epidemic of Kovid. The measures put in place are only to protect the lives of citizens.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia is considered to be a leading country in the field of vaccination against Kovid 19 and create high immunity in society.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen praised the Vanda Institute for joining the Royal Government in training human resources.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he was proud of the decision to allow the private sector to invest in education and to provide opportunities for public universities to pay a partial fee for education.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Royal Government considers the private sector as the locomotive of the national economy.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the growth of the private sector helps provide jobs for people and contribute to the national economy through the payment of taxes. The more the private sector grows, the higher the taxation.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Lenin's theory of economic policy did not kill capitalists, but some practices deviated from Lenin's theory.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that so far Cambodia has not completed its economic reforms.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that customs duties will gradually decrease, while Cambodia's internal taxes (taxes) will increase. Cambodia receives about $ 250 million a month in internal taxes. Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia's internal taxes for the first nine months of 2022 reached about 95 percent, equivalent to nearly $ 3 billion.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen commended all the successful students who overcame their difficulties to acquire knowledge.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that as the Prime Minister and the policy maker, Samdech has the right to speak on issues. This statement came after it was said that Samdech Prakas gave poor cards to the people of Run Ta Ek in search of votes.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the smart system is only available in foreign countries.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen revealed that Samdech currently uses 18 phone numbers.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen warns residents of the Angkor resort area not to negotiate with the Royal Government.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen encourages the confiscation of bank debtors and believes in incitement not to return to the bank.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that many experts assess that the world will move towards the global economic crisis. The crisis in the United States and Europe due to the Russia-Ukraine war affected Asia and our country.
