(Phnom Penh): On the morning of October 3, 2022, the Ministry of National Defense of Cambodia held a meeting to review the results of the past nine months and raise the direction for implementation in the fourth quarter of 2022.
The meeting was chaired by General Neang Phat, Permanent Secretary of State of the Ministry of National Defense, represented by Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of National Defense, with the participation of the leadership of the Ministry of National Defense, the General Command of the Royal Gendarmerie and its subordinates. .
The meeting began with the words "Thank you for the peace and thank you for the win-win politics and thank the founders, the guides and the win-win political operators who bring peace and complete national unity." Then there is the presentation of the report on the performance of the past 9 months.
General Chhum Socheat, Secretary of State and Spokesman for the Ministry of National Defense, confirmed to Fresh News that during the first nine months of 2022, the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces (RCAF) has taken care of its duties and achievements, achieving great achievements. Remarkably.
He said that the situation in the border area for the past nine months has been remarkably calm, with the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces continuing to strengthen national defense in all areas, while the security situation and public order in the country have improved.
The Royal Cambodian Armed Forces (RCAF) has been in charge of and cooperating with the competent authorities at all levels to prevent and suppress all kinds of criminal activities and anarchy, as well as to participate in protecting the security and safety of the security leaders around the 5th Mandate Commune / Sangkat Council Election. Which is evaluated by the national and international community as democratic, transparent, calm, peaceful and non-violent.
He added that the Ministry of National Defense has continued to reform the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces, continuing to revise and establish a number of frameworks in accordance with the necessary requirements, and has been actively involved in vaccinating Kovid-19 in the "blossom" strategy. Get good results and confidence from the head of government.
After listening to the reports and opinions of the institutions under the Ministry of National Defense, General Neang Phat thanked and commended the leadership of the Ministry of National Defense, General Command and all subordinate units for their hard work. Well past.
General Neang Phat, Permanent Secretary of State and Chair of the Meeting, also outlined the work direction for the next quarter, divided into three major points, such as the important work achieved in the first nine months, important international events that should be understood. In the past and the important work to be done.
He claimed that after the construction of the Victory Monument, which is an important achievement of Cambodia, Samdech Picheay Sena worked tirelessly to build the Victory Monument, including the construction of three more locations, first in Koh Kong province. , 2nd in Oddar Meanchey province and 3rd in Pailin province as well.
