Samdech continued that through the registration of Cambodia's temples as a World Heritage Site, it needs to be evaluated in detail by UNESCO. Do not comply with those requirements. In this sense, the Prime Minister asked the people to take care of those cultural assets, not for their own benefit, to affect the interests of the people and the nation as a whole.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Royal Government is requesting the registration of Koh Ker temple in Preah Vihear province into the World Heritage List, and other temples are being considered for registration.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen said, "The case that UNESCO, the World Heritage Committee for the assessment to qualify, if not qualified, they do not accept or they are accepted and expelled, it is a loss. We have placed the temple of Angkor, then the temple of Preah Vihear, then the temple of Sambor Prei Kuk, now we are placing some other temples, we put the temple of Koh Ker, we put a series, this is attention.
* South Koh Ker temple group: Prasat Pram, Prasat Neang Khmao, Prasat Sophy, Prasat Bak, Prasat Bung Lhong, Prasat Kraol, Prasat Chin, Prasat Trapeang Khang Prasat, Prasat Khnar or Prasat Chab Neang, Prasat Ktam
* North Koh Ker group of temples: Trapeang Russey temple, Trapeang Prey temple, Kork Krol temple, Koh temple, Boeung Veng temple, Ta Mean temple, Dan temple, Prasat Rolum, Bei or snail temple, Dang Tong North temple or Ream Ker temple, Dang Tong South temple or Toul Thmor Bai Kret temple, Prasat Krahorm temple Large and so on.
* East Koh Ker group of temples: Prasat Chrap, Prasat Chamres or Prasat Ob Kon, Prasat Banteay Pei Chan or Prasat Andong Kuk, Prasat Beng, Prasat Thleung or Prasat Ling I, Prasat Andong Kuk or Prasat Ling III, Prasat Throne, Prasat Chhnang and so on.
West Koh Ker group of temples: Tuol Krous, Tuol, install the gate, the foundation of the penis, Srong Sralao temple, Kuk Srokum temple, Ling temple, Preah Chey Ling temple, Tuol Pich, etc.
Officials nominated by Moscow in four regions of Ukraine have declared a landslide victory in a referendum to become part of Russia, while the United States plans to push for the adoption of a UN resolution condemning Vote for this one.
