Many countries are moving forward on the path of modernization. The modernization of different countries is unique. China-style modernization will not only benefit the Chinese people, but also bring benefits to people around the world.
First, it provides benefits in reducing global poverty. Over the past 40 years, according to the World Bank's Poverty Standards, the number of poor people in China has been reduced by 800 million, accounting for 75% of the world's total poverty-free population. During the same period. Second, it has benefited from easing the global food crisis.
China-style modernization has another feature: "common prosperity." China will be more open to share more market opportunities with the world. Despite the impact of the 19 19 outbreak of Kovid, many foreign enterprises, including the United States, Europe, Japan, etc., benefited from China more than the global average. And the Chinese government has implemented "foreign investment laws" to protect the rights and legitimate interests of foreign traders.
The Chinese-style modernization process will also bring ecological benefits to the world. To strengthen biodiversity protection, China has established some national parks covering more than 230,000 square kilometers. To further protect and improve the environment, China is working to reduce greenhouse gas emissions and promote the development of renewable energy.
Building a Chinese-style modernization is not a trade-off for the destruction of the planet's environment and energy, but rather a modernization in which humanity and nature develop harmoniously with countries to build a cleaner world. Dear. In addition, it will also provide multidisciplinary benefits such as high technology, human resource transformation and so on.
The above-mentioned benefits all depend on another important benefit that China has provided to the world, namely "peace benefits". Hope you all think of modern China, which has never been colonized, never invaded, never caused war, sincerely hopes for the planet to develop peacefully and stably as a country?
I believe that the 20th Congress of the Communist Party of China, which will be held on October 16, will make everyone see China's sincerity!
