BEIJING, Sept. 28 (Xinhua) - Chinese President Xi Jinping sent a message of congratulations to the High-Level Forum on Human-Cultural Exchange between China and Argentina, hoping that the forum will boost the comprehensive strategic partnership between the two countries. China and Argentina usher in a new era and make greater contributions to promoting the establishment of a common destiny between China and Latin America in the new era, as well as the common destiny of mankind.
Addressing the forum, Argentine President Fernández said he expects the two sides to deepen cooperation to make a greater contribution to the well-being of the two peoples and world peace.
This year marks the 50th anniversary of the establishment of diplomatic relations between China and Argentina. "China and Argentina are good friends and good partners," Chinese President Xi Jinping concluded in his message, confirming the development of bilateral relations over the past half-century. .
From January to July this year, China's exports to Latin America amounted to 9477760 million US dollars, an increase of 21.4% over the same period last year, imports amounted to 8885.420 billion US dollars. More than 8 percent compared to the same period last year. Behind these remarkable achievements is the community of common destiny between China and Latin America, which has grown exponentially in line with the general trend.
In Latin America, there is a saying, "True friends can excite people on the other side of the world." In the future, the giant ship of cooperation between China and Latin America will continue to travel farther and stronger.
