"The 20th Congress of the Communist Party of China, which is scheduled to take place on October 16, 2022, is an important event for the party to determine the party's continued direction in terms of party governance and national governance." This is what Ms. Tuot Panha, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation of Cambodia, said in an interview with Cambodia-China Friendship Radio.
