Mr. Sok Isan also wished and congratulated and was very proud to wish the 20th Congress of the Communist Party of China to be successful and to find a bright path with the leadership of Chinese society as a whole. Towards a successful journey across China, as well as spreading the positive influence emanating from this congress to countries around the world.
