(Beijing): In China's autumn, every year, the golden ripe rice fields cover millions of hectares, dispelling the aroma of attractive grains, vegetables, fruits of all kinds compete to grow and bear fruit continuously. As the Chinese proverb says, "Struggle once pays off" is the happiest moment for Chinese farmers, as they have spent almost half a year cultivating and maintaining it.
Since the mechanization, the harvest of many kinds of crops by Chinese farmers has taken less time, less energy, and yielded faster. Food crops and vegetables are being shipped to markets across the country, ensuring a supply on demand.
Stabilization of China's production and supply chain has stabilized commodity prices in a reasonable range and curbed a sharp rise in inflation, with food output estimated at more than 0.65 trillion kilograms this year. Grams that can meet domestic demand and export.
Farmers are the foundation of the nation's food security, so the Chinese party and government have paid close attention to "rural agriculture and farming." In particular, by the end of 2020, China will have achieved its first "one-century goal" - on the occasion of the 100th anniversary of the founding of the Communist Party of China, it will lift all poor people out of poverty.
In addition, complex globalization and rising inflation are causing some countries to face a food crisis that requires urgent international cooperation, otherwise it will not be easy to overcome this rare recurrence. .
In 2021, China's average per capita food supply was 483 kilograms, far exceeding world safety standards. Based on its resources, China solves one-fifth of the world's food shortages, a major contribution to global food security.
Happiness comes from the struggle. Chinese leaders often say, "Whether people have a good life or not, it depends on whether people have a happy smile." Indeed, making people, especially farmers, with happy smiles, is one of the most important work directions of the Chinese government, and the yield of stockpiled agricultural products is a clear guarantee of "pot" and security. The Chinese people's food and contribute to maintaining global food security.
