On behalf of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian People's Party and on behalf of the party leadership, Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng thanked all party members and supporters who voted in favor of giving confidence to the candidates that the party has prepared to stand. Vote for commune councils and get successful results.
On that occasion, Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng happily reminded when he received requests to contribute to building achievements in Prey Veng province from philanthropists, including government leaders, lawmakers and philanthropists from the private sector. About building kindergartens that are important for young children who are the children of the people.
Samdech Krala Hom continued that the construction of schools and the teaching process in kindergartens is a path of education in civil society, because this kind of kindergarten is a class that trains young children to have good qualifications for further study. Continuously and also related to their future life, including cultivating the courage of children to make children wonder, ask questions, want to know, which is a contributing factor to make children smart.
Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng also expressed his deep gratitude to all the benefactors, including the team consisting of General Santh Bandith Neth Savoeun, Chairman of the Svay Antor and Kanhchriech District Assistance Team, for their continuous and extensive support for the construction of special infrastructure. Schools, roads, pagodas and other public buildings for the people to use.
