Kampong Speu Provincial Administration Calls on Citizens to Increase Awareness of the Impact of Hurricane Nou and Report to the Authorities as soon as possible for timely rescue
(Kampong Speu): The administration of Kampong Speu province has called on the people living in some vulnerable areas in the province to be very careful to avoid any danger caused by the effects of the typhoon and to report to the authorities as soon as possible to the authorities. Able to take preventive and preventive measures in a timely manner.
According to the provincial administration, this situation will allow Kampong Speu province as well as other provinces to receive moderate to heavy rainfall combined with more rainfall from the above areas.
In connection with this situation, in order to ensure safety and prevent any possible accidents in a timely manner, all citizens, especially those living in some vulnerable areas in Kampong Speu province, should be very careful to avoid the occurrence of other accidents. .
In case of any affected people, please report and provide information as soon as possible to the authorities of villages, communes, sangkats, districts, provinces immediately so that the authorities can take measures to prevent and rescue in time.
