The film "History of the Life of a Pagoda Boy" was written on July 08, 1996 by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia and directed by Mr. Hun Heng, performed by National Radio of Cambodia, sung by Mr. Yin Sarin and now sung by Returned by Mr. Chin Vathana, arranged by Mr. Bou Vann Monireak and Mr. Keo Mara and directed by Mr. Fay Sam Ang.
The historical song film "Life of a Pagoda Boy" is a wonderful scene with rich meanings, images and tastes about the real life story and the struggle of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the son of a farmer and all kinds of difficulties for knowledge It is an invaluable asset.
The characters in this story are all well-known artists who have enough experience to perform in all tastes of life, crying, laughing, leaving a sour face ... is all possible. Among them are Dy Saveth, Miss Duong Soryda, Mr. Chhim Sakda, Mr. Panh Khemmanu, brother of Ouk Odom, Miss Nita Vorvong, Mr. Meng Bunlo, Mr. Pov Piseth, Ms. Ly Marina and many more.
The producer praised and appreciated the team of artists who have sacrificed their physical and mental strength to perform, no matter how hot, cold, day and night, down to the muddy lake. Dear short cut to suit the story.
At the same time, Mr. Fay Sam Ang, the director of the film "Life of a Young Pagoda", confirmed that this unique historical work has big tasks and decisions that need to be made carefully, including the language, dialogue, cast, casting location. In addition, there are modern technical equipment, cutting techniques to be used for production, including a team of experts from all fields that can not be lacking.
Oknha Heng Long, President of the Association of Friends of Voluntary Arts to Help Society and a producer, said that there will be special poems related to the music film, which is the real life of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia.
It should be reminded that the song "Life of a Pagoda Boy" was once produced as a gesture song in 2000 by Z Meas Production under the direction of Mr. Fay Sam Ang and also has a lot of support from the public, especially this remake is in the form of a movie And the best.
