These actions exacerbate the arms race and the risk of nuclear proliferation, which has hampered international efforts to reduce weapons, contrary to the goal of eliminating nuclear weapons and creating a world without weapons. Nuclear, therefore, must be stopped immediately.
Geng Shuang said that China will continue to actively pursue true multilateralism, and work with the international community to push forward the denuclearization process, and make unremitting efforts to build a world without nuclear weapons and achieve The common security of all mankind.
