On the occasion of the 14th Ben Day, General Soeng Samnang and his wife, as well as Buddhists, showed a sincere smile and enjoyed building merit with Buddhism on the occasion of this national traditional festival.
Please be informed that Pchum Ben is one of the biggest festivals of all for Buddhists and this festival lasts for 15 days, from the 1st of Roach to the 15th of Roach. This is celebrated by the Cambodian people of Buddhism every year.
According to the records of the history of the Khmer festival, the celebration of this festival is to pray for the dedication of Kosal Phal Bon to the parents and relatives of the seven descendants who have passed away so that they can come and receive Kosal Phal Bon to be born in death.
