General Kun Kim did not forget to call on all veterans to join in maintaining the hard-earned peace, and all veterans are well aware of the hardships caused by the flames of war. The senior minister stressed that what Cambodian veterans get today is because Cambodia is peaceful.
On that occasion, General Kun Kim also urged the leaders of the association at all levels to continue to pay attention to veterans living in communes. Divide the tasks, meet, talk and connect more closely with the veterans in the family in the back of each house. Ukraine announces easing of ties with Iran over drone supply to Russia
