He also donated a boat and a large engine worth $ 870.
He also stated that so far, some communes in Phnom Srok district are also flooded, including Nantao commune, Phnom Dey commune, Poi Char commune, where the team is monitoring and providing first aid to the people.
Mr. Serey Kosal also thanked and commended Mr. Ou Rathrey, Chairman of Banteay Meanchey Provincial Unity Command and all kinds of armed forces, including the Ministry of Water Resources and Meteorology, for their efforts and equipment to go to the flood site to facilitate the people. Well. In particular, prepared strength and timely food to help the people as well.
He also thanked his team for providing financial support, even if it is small, to help people affected by the floods.
