The Cambodian Confederation of Trade Unions fully supports the National Minimum Wage Council statement.
The Cambodian Trade Union Confederation also thanked Cambodian Prime Minister Samdech Techo Hun Sen for adding $ 2 to the $ 200 minimum wage. The Cambodian Trade Union Confederation considers this addition to be a high consideration for the well-being of workers throughout Cambodia.
