Siem Reap Provincial Authority temporarily closes all types of heavy trucks in the province due to heavy rains
(Siem Reap): The Siem Reap Provincial Department of Public Works and Transport (MPWT) has announced the temporary closure of all types of heavy trucks on the Siem Reap Provincial Road after heavy rains.
According to the announcement of the Department of Public Works and Transport of Siem Reap Province, issued on September 22, 2022, which states that due to the flood situation, it has been flooding heavily, causing some roads to be inundated. The geography of Siem Reap province, where such a situation makes the road-bridge unable to support the weight of heavy trucks and to prevent possible accidents and prevent damage to the road-bridge structure.
In addition, the Department of Public Works and Transport of Siem Reap Province hopes and strongly believes in the spirit and will of the owners of all heavy trucks will cooperate to contribute to the maintenance of roads and bridges for long-term use.
