Mr. Tim Panou, Governor of Chbar Morn City, said that the joint team of the joint police force inspected a coffee shop at the bus stop of Kampong Speu Market in the commercial village, Sangkat Rokar Thom, Chbar Morn City. Two people were arrested: First, Sokhom Vann Lida, female, 17 years old, living in Kraing Pol Tep village, Sangkat Chbar Morn, Chbar Morn City, and Second: Voeun Sovey, male, 39 years old, living in Khtom Kraing village, Sangkat Chbar Morn, Chbar Morn City.
