Commentary: Cambodian Senate Library Modernized with Chinese Aid
(Phnom Penh): The Senate Library of Cambodia has received continuous development assistance from the Chinese side, especially recently, China has helped develop into an e-library that will contribute more to the cultivation of ideas, especially to provide opportunities for the public. Get to know China better, because books related to China have received a lot of support from readers, both senators and the general public.
