(Phnom Penh): 300 members of the Cyclo Foundation in Phnom Penh received the budget and materials of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Honorary President of the Cambodian Tricycle Foundation (Cyclo) and Prime Minister of Cambodia on the occasion of Pchum Ben.
These funds and materials were handed over by Mr. Met Meas Pheakdey, Spokesperson of Phnom Penh Capital Administration and Chairman of the Secretariat of the Cambodian Tricycle Foundation on behalf of Mr. Khuong Sreng, Governor of Phnom Penh and Chairman of the Board of the Cambodian Tricycle Foundation. September 22, 2022 at Phnom Penh Capital Hall.
Mr. Met Meas Pheakdey said that Samdech Techo Hun Sen always reminded Mr. Khuong Sreng to take care and take care of the well-being of the members of the cyclo drivers in Phnom Penh. Of Samdech Techo Hun Sen on the occasion of Pchum Ben, in addition to the monthly support for them, each of them received 50,000 Riels (by Kong Wing), 2 cases of noodles, 2 cases of pure water and 1 can of fish sauce.
