General knowledge: Understand why the sun rises at the center of Angkor Wat
(Siem Reap): The Sunrise Event at the top of the central tower of Angkor Wat Researchers call this event the night, when night and day have the same duration. Find out why the sun rises at the center of Angkor Wat.
Meanwhile, according to Indian astronomical rules, time is divided according to the course of the moon and the sun, which is the lunar and solar system. In the orbit of the sun, a year is divided into two journeys of 189 days and 176 days. Since Angkor Wat is related to the love cycle of the universe, the age figures of each age relate to the length of the main structures of Angkor Wat that researchers have discovered in the past.
Mr. M. Sokrithy explained through the results of that research that the scale used by ancient architects and engineers is hand. The length of the hut is not the same for each royal generation, that is, during the construction of Angkor Wat, the government used the scale of the hut was equal to 0.436 meters.
Based on this scale, we can find out about the length of the main structures of Angkor Wat as follows:
1. The distance of the bridge over the bridge in front of Angkor Wat is 439.78 cubits.
2. The distance from the porch from Ta Reach prison to the second gallery is 867.03 ha
3. Distance from Ta Reach Prison to the first staircase up to Bakant, length 1296.07 ha
4. The distance from the front of the dragon to the central tower of Bakan is 1734.41 cubic meters.
If we deliberately exclude some gaps, which are the tradition of carpenters and fillers, as well as subtract the remainder of the required integers, we will be able to understand the relationship between the length of the main structure of Angkor Wat and age. The era of the love cycle of the universe can be summarized as follows:
2. The distance from Ta Reach Prison to the Second Gallery can be estimated to be 864,000 years old.
3. The distance from Ta Reach Prison to the first staircase up to Bakan can be estimated to be 1,296,000 years old.
4. The distance from the front of the dragon to the central tower of Bakan can be estimated to be 1,728,000 years old.
Calculated by astronomical and cosmological rules, the ancient architects built Angkor Wat to be both the universe and the love cycle of the universe, with the central tower of Angkor Wat as the center and the zero point marking the sun's orbit. Between 189 days and 176 days, the sun will reach this point. According to this rule, only once a year does the sun rise directly over the central peak of Angkor Wat twice a year on a regular basis.
The actual equinox in September 2017 is on September 22 at 8:02 pm Global time, which is the time in Cambodia in the early morning on September 23 at 3:02. However, the event of the sunrise at the top of Angkor Wat will take place in the early morning on September 22, 2017. It's a coincidence that the September 2017 sunrise event will coincide with the Islamic New Year.
(Koh Kong): More than 80 foreigners were arrested by police under the coordination of prosecutors during a crackdown on suspected online gambling crimes at the Thantai Guesthouse in Village 3, Sangkat Smach Meanchey, Royal Khmer City, in the afternoon of September 21, 2022.
Koh Kong Provincial Prosecutor Ros Saram said he was continuing to search for the ringleaders of the group of 82 migrants (28 women), most of whom were Indonesians staying at the Thantai Guesthouse.
Separately, Mr. Yous Chanvichet, Police Inspector of Khemarak Phoumin City, said that he had sent a police force to monitor the presence of immigrants in his local area for two days, that is, to find their location and to suspect that they were secretly committing gambling crimes. Online settlement.
According to the inspector, the group of 82 immigrants had already traveled from Sihanoukville to stay at the "Thantai" guesthouse, without the owner of the guesthouse reporting to the authorities.
Of the 86 people, seven were Vietnamese who did not have enough passports and documents and were immediately sent to the provincial police commission to build a case.
Japan needs at least $ 105 billion stimulus package
TOKYO (Reuters) - Japan needs a new spending package worth at least $ 105 billion, a senior Japanese ruling party official has said. According to Reuters.
His remarks came Tuesday after a group of Japanese lawmakers called for more economic stimulus to curb the impact of rising inflation.
"We need a large, comprehensive budget," he said, referring to the Japanese government's spending package next month.
Japanese Prime Minister Fumio Kishida, who has seen public support for his cabinet fall in recent weeks, is under pressure from his coalition government to push for the release. New measures to boost his popularity and boost Japan's fragile economy According to Reuters.
