The senior minister further stated that the preparation was carried out quickly because CRBC has experience in building a highway, including sufficient equipment and can know the weather in Cambodia properly.
For Senior Minister Sun Chanthol, the Phnom Penh-Bavet Expressway is another important economic artery for Cambodia.
