Mr. Rofi Osman expressed his deep gratitude to Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Head of the Royal Government of Cambodia, for leading Cambodia to become a country of peace, stability and development in all areas. Under the leadership of Samdech Techo, harmony was guaranteed, there was no discrimination, no racism or religion. In addition, the Cambodian government is always involved in resolving all the concerns and needs of the Cambodian people.
