Mr. Khleang Huot considered that "This bidding is the participation of the private sector in a competitive way to participate in the bidding for Sangkat development projects to build achievements in the commune and participate in local development according to the needs of the people." Therefore, quality, technical standards, aesthetics, reasonable prices are necessary for the company that pays the winning price and the project owner, who is the Sangkat Council.
