* Third: For Sangkat Project Management Committee: There must be regular monitoring and inspection of project implementation, especially review and comment written in the workbook on a regular basis, be responsible for project results, monitor progress reports. And the issuance of payment mandates and guarantees, and make official improvements in the site book when inspecting the project site.
