(Stung Treng): Ms. Kut Bunmey, Member of Stung Treng Provincial Council and Chairman of the Provincial CCC, urged the multi-sectoral response team on gender-based violence to continue to work together to prevent and prevent violence related to Gender in all its forms, such as domestic violence, sexual abuse, trafficking in women and children, and finding solutions for them in a timely manner, especially women or children who live in poverty, helplessness, and helplessness.
