The weekly meeting of the leaders of the Ministry of Information, which was held this morning, discussed and exchanged experiences with each other to make the implementation of all tasks more effective and better results. The meeting also reviewed the work done in the past and set out information work plans for major international events hosted by Cambodia.
The meeting also discussed the outreach action plan, which the Ministry of Information is responsible for recording and broadcasting the events of the 32nd Southeast Asian Games 2023, which Cambodia is hosting.
