The Kan Ben and Pchum Ben festivals in 2022 take place from the 1st of Roach to the 15th of Roach, which is the 11th to the 25th of September 2022. Commentary: Promoting the spirit of Shanghai The Shanghai Cooperation Organization will definitely make a greater contribution to safeguarding global peace and development.
BEIJING, Sept. 16 (Xinhua) - Chinese President Xi Jinping delivered a keynote speech at the 22nd Shanghai Cooperation Organization (SCO) Head of State Council meeting on September 16, highlighting five areas of growth experience. The meeting of the Shanghai Cooperation Organization (SCO) and the proposal on the establishment of a more cohesive community of the Shanghai Cooperation Organization (SCO) were widely agreed upon by the meeting.
These proposals, raised in the face of actual competition, will strongly oppose any attempt by outside forces to interfere in the internal affairs of the member states of the Shanghai Cooperation Organization and cause chaos in the region. These mobilized more collective forces to oppose unilateralism as well as to promote equality and justice.
These will be conducive to pioneering the cooperation potential of the Shanghai Cooperation Organization, providing greater common interests to member states, to achieve these goals, China has made real efforts.
It should also be noted that the "Samarqand Declaration" issued by the summit incorporates the global security initiatives that China has mentioned, which may indicate that China's initiatives are worthy of attention. Consideration and common needs of the member states of the Shanghai Cooperation Organization.
It's a long way, but as long as you stick to it, you will reach your destination. Under the guidance of the "Shanghai Spirit", the Shanghai Cooperation Organization will definitely be an anchor for regional security stability as well as a greater contribution to safeguarding global peace and development.
Hotline Police Find 9 Victims, Detain 7 Suspects and Find 37 Chinese Illegal Residents
(Phnom Penh): The specialized force of Preah Sihanouk Provincial Police on September 18, 2022 yesterday inspected the location of the New Energy Hotel in Preah Sihanouk Province, finding 9 ethnic victims. Detained 7 suspects and continued to search for 37 Chinese nationals (5 females) suspected of staying illegally in Cambodia (smuggling).
General Khieu Sopheak, a spokesman for the Ministry of Interior, confirmed to Fresh News that the inspection operation was carried out after a hotline on Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng's team said that nine Chinese men were suspected. Illegal confinement in a new energy hotel in Sihanoukville.
General Khieu Sopheak confirmed that on September 18, 2022 at 11:30 AM, the specialized force of Sihanoukville Provincial Police and in cooperation with the Private Security Management Department of the Ministry of Interior arrived at the location of the new power building. In Village 1, Sangkat 3, Preah Sihanouk Province, to find 9 Chinese men suspected of being illegally detained:
At the same time, the general said that with the cooperation of the owner of the location, the police found the 9 victims were Chinese men and arrested 7 suspects, male, Cambodian. Watch the victim not to leave the living room. During the operation, law enforcement forces searched and found 37 Chinese nationals (5 females) suspected of staying illegally in Cambodia (smuggling).
