At the same time, she added that she did not expect that Cambodia is now progressive, not inferior to other countries, everything is there and modern, most importantly, there is peace, security everywhere with a faster pace of development than expected. .
Ministry of Economy opens training course on procedures for performing internal audit work for 76 officials of ministries and institutions
(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Economy and Finance on September 19, 2022 opened a training course on "Procedures for the implementation of internal audit work" to a total of 76 target trainees as auditors of ministries and institutions to contribute and support Public Financial Management Reform - Phase 3 plus 2 and readiness to implement Phase 4.
The ceremony was presided over by Dr. Hean Sahip, Secretary of State and Chair of the Ministry of Economy and Finance Capacity Building Working Group, accompanied by Deputy Secretary-General, Secretary General, Deputy Director General, Deputy Director General, Trainers, Trainers and Trainers under the coordination of Institute of Economics and Finance, Ministry of Economy and Finance.
Dr. Hean Sahip emphasized that performance accountability was the ultimate goal of public financial management reform. Through this, achievement information plays an important role in the decision to allocate budget or resources, combined with other information related to the economy, politics and administration to implement projects, programs and policies.
Achievement Information Budget is the preparation of an annual budget package linked to the achievements of ministries and institutions that have been proposed or achieved over the past year. This budget system provides the flexibility to create a program structure that relies on or does not depend entirely on the administrative structure and requires the measurement of the effectiveness and efficiency of the program through performance indicators, linking the year and final results.
Dr. Hean Sahip further emphasized that the Ministry of Economy and Finance considers building and developing the capacity of civil servants as necessary work to ensure success in the management of the economy and public finance and to support the implementation of key reform programs. The main purpose of the Royal Government is to raise the living standard and increase the efficiency of providing public services to the people.
He said that the training on "Procedures for the implementation of internal audit work" is a key program of building and developing the capacity of civil servants to contribute to the strengthening of understanding and enhance the professional capacity and dissemination of legal documents. Technical work to meet the urgent needs of implementing public financial management reform of the Royal Government.
In an interview with reporters after the meeting at the Ministry of Interior, Prince Sar Kheng claimed that illegal gambling was the root cause of all forms of human trafficking in Cambodia.
Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng stated, "Regarding the fight against all forms of human trafficking through torture, labor trafficking, and real fraud, it starts from illegal gambling." "Illegal gambling is the cancer of society. If we do not solve it, the virus will spread and complicate social problems."
According to Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng, the Royal Government of Cambodia has set out three mechanisms for all parties involved, including rescuing victims, cracking down on gambling and punishing perpetrators (illegal gambling).
In addition, Samdech Sar Kheng also recommended to increase the management of foreigners who come to Cambodia properly, including checking the work permit to work in companies or enterprises to avoid falling into various tactics in response to the instructions. Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, must implement it clearly.
According to the Minister of Interior, in relation to the crackdown on gambling crimes, the Capital-Provincial Unity Command is in charge of its local jurisdiction and must crack down on all online gambling or Other construction games in all forms.
He further stressed that the crackdown on gambling must be carried out in accordance with the law in force, including cracking down on illegal gambling and inspecting and resolving it as it has done in the past. Sihanoukville Province.
Please be reminded that Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, has issued a strict order for all relevant officials, especially sub-national officials, to crack down on all types of illegal gambling. If any Capital / Provincial Governor is not responsible for the role of allowing gambling to spread in his / her locality, Samdech Techo will not hesitate to remove him / her from his / her position.
After the strict order of Samdech Techo Prime Minister a few days ago, we observed that the competent authorities, especially the Capital-Provincial Unity Command itself, have made efforts to crack down day and night and lead to the arrest of people. The Ministry of Economy held a seminar to disseminate the sub-decree on the framework of functions and duties of the internal audit and the sub-decree on the rules and procedures for financial inspection.
(Phnom Penh): The General Secretariat of the Ministry of Economy and Finance held a seminar to disseminate the sub-decree on the framework of functions and duties of the internal audit and inspection, as well as the sub-decree on the rules and procedures for financial inspection.
In addition, this sub-decree applies to the internal audit and inspection functions of the Ministry, the Financial Inspection Institutions of the Ministry of Economy and Finance, the Public Function Inspection of the Ministry, the Public Functions and the Ministry of National Assembly-Senate Relations and Inspection.
