(Phnom Penh): The Governor of Phnom Penh, Mr. Khuong Sreng, expressed his deep appreciation to the fire and rescue police of the Phnom Penh Municipal Police, the fire police of the Ministry of Interior, Phnom Penh Capital Hall and the fire brigade for their excellent work. Good enough to receive praise from the people for intervening to put out the fire in time.
This expression of appreciation took place this morning, September 19, 2022, as he invited and gave gifts to 145 fire and rescue police of Phnom Penh Municipal Police on the occasion of Pchum Ben National Day. At the Fire Prevention and Rescue Police Office of the Phnom Penh Municipal Police.
