His Excellency Dr. Kin Phea, President of the Cambodian Institute of International Relations of the Royal Academy of Cambodia, who also attended the forum, told the Cambodia-China Friendship Radio that it was noteworthy that HE assessed that this forum is really important and promotes mutual understanding. Better as part of public diplomacy in people-to-people relations.
He explained that when journalists can understand each other and bring real information based on scientific evidence, factual evidence, enough facts, then the people of both ASEAN and China can get real information. When people get real information, the picture of ASEAN-China relations is accurate, intelligent and conscientious.
