Mr. Chea Chanto built a new school building and library for Chea Sim High School, Kampong Thmor, Kampong Thom Province to facilitate the study of students
(Kampong Thom): Mr. Chea Chanto, Permanent Member of the Central Committee of the Cambodian People's Party and Chairman of the Central Working Group for Kampong Thom Province, built a new school building with 2 floors and 12 rooms and built a library for Chea Sim High School. Kampong Thmor is located in Balang Commune, Baray District, Kampong Thom Province.
The new school building and library building were donated by Mr. Chea Chanto and Ms. Khieu Sina Chea Chanto together with philanthropists. This offer was made during a meeting with 276 12th grade teachers and students in Chea Kampong Thmor High School on September 15, 2022.
This offer is made after examining the needs and shortages of classrooms in the new school year of Kampong Thmor High School students.
Mr. Chea Chanto said that now the youth has played the most important role and importance of the nation because the youth is a force to be reckoned with as an important human resource with potential for national development if a country is rich in good human resources combined with political stability. That nation will surely develop and prosper.
He continued, "Cambodian youth in this era strive to learn and develop well with this knowledge, due to a peaceful society and good political stability, a great asset that provides opportunities for young people to be able to Decide to prepare for the future to participate in the development of the country.
He added that in this context, young people need to remember to cooperate and compete, so as a successor must have the ability and good discipline to achieve fruitful results in the future, each student has Strive and be patient in learning.
Mr. Chea Chanto provided study materials and funds to all 276 teachers and students preparing for the 2022 High School Diploma Examination, as well as provided funds to support teachers to help teach for two months for students to be tested.
