Phnom Penh Capital Administration: Repair of foundation and AC rubber on National Road 2, nearly 5 km long, is scheduled to be completed by the end of September
(Phnom Penh): The working group of the Department of Public Works and Transport of Phnom Penh, following the instructions of Mr. Khuong Sreng, the Governor of Phnom Penh, has been repairing the foundation and ironing AC of National Road No. 2, nearly 5 kilometers long, to facilitate the traffic of People, while this stretch of road is damaged, it is difficult to travel and also to enhance the beauty of Phnom Penh.
Mr. Sam Piseth, Director of the Department of Public Works and Transport of Phnom Penh, said on the morning of September 16, 2022 that in accordance with the instructions of Mr. Khuong Sreng recently, the department has been working on repairing foundations and rubber. AC National Road No. 2, 4 and a half kilometers long and 18 meters wide, from the flyover to the Preah Noray roundabout (Phnom Penh-Kandal border).
Mr. Sam Piseth confirmed that the construction work started on September 1, 2022 and is scheduled to be completed on September 30, 2022, that is, it will take only one month to make this stretch of road beautiful and make people Can travel back and forth easily.
