(Siem Reap): On September 15, 2022, Mr. Thong Bunthary, President of the Cambodian Young Entrepreneurs Association, Siem Reap Branch, led a 15-member Board of Directors and Chairman-Vice-Chairman of the Commission to pay a courtesy call on Duke Kith Meng. President of the Cambodian Chamber of Commerce.
