According to leaked documents, prisoner Sam Rainsy signed an agreement with indigenous Vietnamese leader Kok Sar in 2013. The agreement clearly states that the indigenous peoples of Vietnam are entitled to their own autonomy, that is, the right to make and implement decisions on matters relating to their internal and regional affairs in Cambodia.
