It should be reminded that in the first phase, a total of 1117 families from Trapeang Ses and Tasin Tbong villages volunteered to run for Run Ta Ek Natural Village, and in the second phase for Veal village, there were about 1,000 more families who volunteered to accept the Royal Resolution Policy. The government.
