(Phnom Penh): Secretary of State for the Ministry of Health and Chair of the Commission for the 19-Kovid Vaccination Nationwide, Ms. O Vandin once again called on all people to pay attention to vaccination. Kovid 19 Dosage encourages everyone to strengthen their immune system to prevent the onslaught of this deadly disease.
Ms. O Vandin's appeal message was made this morning, September 15, 2022, at a press conference of the Royal Government Spokesperson's Unit under the theme "Achievements for 5 years of the Ministry of Health" after she observed That the momentum of people going to the vaccination dose does not seem to increase much compared to the basic dose.
