Ms. O Vandin emphasized that the people should not believe in any unfortunate propaganda related to vaccination against Kovid 19, especially the booster dose. She claims that the unfortunate propaganda related to this is not new, that is, from the very beginning when Cambodia started vaccinating people against Kovid 19.
