At the same time, the chairperson of the Commission on Affairs also reminded and instructed the sub-committee on capital-provincial affairs to further mobilize people to get vaccinated and to organize a team of doctors to vaccinate or guide people. People come to get vaccinated at health facilities such as health centers, referral hospitals and so on.
