During the meeting with the people, the Deputy Governor mentioned the purpose so that the people in Kien Svay district, in particular and in general in the whole of Kandal province, have proper toilets and use toilets to stop open defecation. Harm to health, loss of money, risk due to poisonous animals if going out to defecate in the open at night, especially to help the beauty, hygiene and good environment.
