Tomorrow morning, Samdech Techo Hun Sen announces the opening of the 54th ASEAN Economic Ministers' Meeting and related meetings
(Phnom Penh): On the morning of Wednesday, September 14, 2022, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia and Chairman of ASEAN, will preside over the opening ceremony of the 54th ASEAN Economic Ministers' Meeting and related meetings organized by the Ministry. Cambodian business held at Sokha Hotel, Siem Reap.
The Ministry of Commerce of Cambodia, the national representative for the ASEAN Economic Community Council, will host the 54th ASEAN Economic Ministers' Meeting and related meetings from 11 to 18 September 2022.
The 54th ASEAN Economic Ministers' Meeting will be held on September 14 and 15. Relevant meetings to be held at the event, such as the Cambodia-Laos-Myanmar-Vietnam Economic Ministers' Meeting and other consultative meetings between the ASEAN Economic Ministers and the ASEAN Dialogue Partners, will be held from the 16th to the 16th. September 18
Mr. Pen Sovichet also stated that Cambodia is ready to work closely with all ASEAN Member States, ASEAN Partners and the ASEAN Secretary-General to push for further efforts in the process of building the ASEAN Economic Community and accelerating economic recovery. Re-overcome all the problems that ASEAN is facing and move forward with strength, solidarity and friendship in line with the core spirit of ASEAN "One Vision, One Identity, One Community".
"The ASEAN Economic Ministers' Meeting is one of the most important meetings because in this meeting we highlight a large number of economic achievements that are relevant to the interests of ASEAN as a whole. In particular, focusing on programs that benefit the interests of the host country. This is the confirmation of Mr. Pen Sovicheat.
Mr. Ben Sovichet added, "The agenda that we have raised together is not only for the benefit of Cambodia, but also for the overall agenda that is relevant to the future economic destiny of ASEAN as a whole." "And raising all these agendas reflects and benefits the closer and broader relationship between ASEAN and partner countries."
According to a spokesman for the Ministry of Commerce, the ASEAN Economic Ministers' Meeting, hosted by Cambodia, will also address the development gap between ASEAN member countries.
Mr. Pen Sovichet also expressed the expectation that through the meeting hosted by Cambodia will make the ASEAN economy as well as partners better by finding new ways to lead the program and cooperation. Better operation.
Mr. Pen Sovicheat considers that the current ASEAN Economic Ministers' Meeting is an honor for Cambodia to be able to hold a meeting directly after the Kovid 19 crisis. He also expressed the hope that through the ASEAN Economic Ministers' Meeting and related meetings held in Siem Reap now will help promote tourism in Cambodia after the Kovid 19 crisis.
It should be noted that in 2022, Cambodia became the third rotating chair of ASEAN after becoming a member of ASEAN in 1999. Last August, Cambodia successfully hosted the 55th ASEAN Foreign Ministers' Meeting and related meetings.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen Highly Appreciates the Outcome of the ASEAN Foreign Ministers' Meeting and Related Meetings, which Outline Cambodia's Talent, Especially Deputy Prime Minister Prak Sokhon, Minister of Foreign Affairs There are major hot issues, such as the Russia-Ukraine war, tensions between China and Taiwan, as well as Myanmar.
The ASEAN-Partner Summit will be held in late November 2022. Cambodia has become the first ASEAN member country to hold a major meeting in the region directly after the 19 19 outbreak of Kovid.
Senior Minister Sun Chanthol leads a team to bring a robot to inspect the internal drainage system in Siem Reap
(Siem Reap): Senior Minister Sun Chanthol, Minister of Public Works and Transport, on September 13, 2022, led a technical team to inspect the road and sewer infrastructure in Siem Reap with the participation of the Ministry in charge. And relevant professional officers.
The inspection involves the use of a robotic machine to inspect the sewer system, which is a state-of-the-art technology equipped with a camera that can see the actual condition of the internal drainage system, congestion or damage to take timely action.
On that occasion, the Senior Minister inspected and took measures to solve as well as find the cause of the flooding of some roads in Siem Reap and the collapse of the banks of the Siem Reap River and damage to some infrastructure on August 15. The year 2022 has also passed.
Senior Minister Sun Chanthol also instructed and requested all people to take care of the roads, clean the sidewalks in front of the house and keep the garbage properly because garbage is a source of congestion to the sewer system in particular. Do not pour soil higher than the road, which can cause flooding, damage the road prematurely, and please respect the traffic law to avoid traffic accidents.
