A total of about 500 foreign dignitaries are expected to attend the funeral of Queen Elizabeth in London, with official invitations sent to the heads of state of several countries with diplomatic ties to the United Kingdom. World leaders, from US President Joe Biden to the Prime Ministers of Canada, Australia and New Zealand, have all announced their participation in the event.
