"This is an important step for the project to promote sustainable energy practices in the textile sector, which is expected to work together to enhance the sustainability and energy efficiency of the garment sector," the statement said. Cambodia. "Promoting sustainable energy practices is recognized as a leading factor in responding to the current situation and increasing the competitiveness of Cambodian garment factories."
