(Kampot): Dr. Mao Thunin, Governor of Kampot Province, said that all workers in the province are qualified and contribute to the Royal Government in social development and nation building, those contributions are from Work hard to comply with our country's labor laws.
This statement was made while Mr. Chheng Phalla, Chairman of the Provincial Council and Dr. Governor of Kampot Province Mao Thunin led a group of government officials, the Armed Forces, the authorities and many stakeholders to visit and talk with workers in The ball sewing factory of "Dapon Kampot Store" is located in Andong Khmer Village, Sangkat Andong Khmer, Kampot City on September 13, 2022.
Mr. Mao Thunin continued that what the workers have participated in the development and building of the country is the effort to work in accordance with the Cambodian labor law, in accordance with the principles of factories, especially there is no protest or demand. Excessive which can cause investors to lose confidence.
The provincial governor also asked all relatives, nieces and nephews of workers to continue to work hard and continue to maintain the value of the work that we have today for the benefit and recognition of our values as Khmer. From investors of all kinds.
During the ceremony, there was also a raffle for workers, which includes: 2 motorcycles, 2 bicycles, 10 fans, 20 electric cookers and 10 electric kettles. At the same time, Dr. Governor also promised to meet before the Khmer New Year and will bring 6 motorcycles, 3 from the owner and 3 as a gift. From him as the provincial governor himself.
Mr. Ung Poheng, Director of the Department of Labor and Vocational Training of Kampot Province, said in his report that the company "Dapon Kampot Store" tennis factory has a total of 170 workers, 163 women. The company has a total area of 1,200 square meters, one production building, which is active in the production of decals for export to the United States and Japan.
It should be reminded that on September 11, 2022, Dr. Mao Thunin and Mr. Chheng Phalla led the civil servants, the Armed Forces and the relevant authorities under their supervision to visit and meet with more than 700 workers in "Pochen Cambodia Co., Ltd." is located in Kandal Toul Village, Kampong Trach Khang Lech Commune, Kampong Trach District, Kampot Province.
On September 12, 2022, Dr. Mao Thunin, Provincial Governor and HE Chheng Phalla, Chairman of Kampot Provincial Council, led a total of 650 workers and civil servants of the Armed Forces and relevant authorities. At the factory of "Cambodian Thai Food" in Tvi Khang Tbong village, Sangkat Andong Khmer, Kampot city, Kampot province.
The Cambodian-Thai Footwear factory produces footwear for export to the United States, with a total of 570 workers, 497 of whom are women. During today's meeting, Dr. Mao Thunin, Governor of Kampot will also promise to visit and talk with workers in all factories of companies in Kampot in the future.
