(Phnom Penh): Residents found the body of a Chinese man at Boeung Kamblok, 60 meters from the road in Prek Talong 3 village, Chak Angre Krom commune, Meanchey district. This incident caused a surprise on the afternoon of September 12, 2022.
The body of the Chinese man was found to have fallen from the third floor of a condominium, causing serious injuries at around 2 am on September 11, 2022. Points in Rooms 303 and 304, Building 172, Street 167, Village 3, Sangkat Toul Tum Poung II, Khan Chamkarmon. But when the victim fell, the same Chinese man was found in a car and disappeared, thought to be taken to the hospital.
Unlike the eyewitnesses who thought the victim was being taken to hospital, the same Chinese man threw the victim back into the lake, raising suspicions.
The forensic authorities of the Phnom Penh Municipal Police concluded that the victim died from severe head and body injuries and was taken from the place where the four suspects fell from the building and dropped into the lake 60 meters. He is currently being held at Stung Meanchey pagoda, waiting to contact the embassy to find a family to receive. The new Guatemalan ambassador to Cambodia is committed to strengthening cultural and trade ties between the two countries.
This confirmation of the position of the newly appointed Ambassador of the Republic of Guatemala was made on the occasion that he was allowed by Samdech Vibol Sena Pheakdey Say Chhum, Acting Head of State of the Kingdom of Cambodia, to present his credentials on the morning of the 13th. September 2022 at the Senate.
Through this meeting, the newly appointed ambassador said that Cambodia is a country with a rich culture, especially Angkor and many tourist sites.
The Ambassador stressed that he will work to further enhance relations and cooperation between the Republic of Guatemala and the ASEAN region because ASEAN member countries have the potential for economic and trade exchanges.
On that occasion, the Ambassador conveyed a heartfelt greeting from the President of the Republic of Guatemala to His Majesty King Norodom Sihamoni, King of the Kingdom of Cambodia and to the top national leaders of the Kingdom of Cambodia. Kingdom of Cambodia as well.
The Acting Head of State remarked with pleasure on the good relations, friendship and cooperation between the people of the two countries and the continuous development.
Samdech is confident that as the Ambassador of the Republic of Guatemala to the Kingdom of Cambodia, he will continue to strive to maintain the good tradition of friendship and cooperation between the people and the two countries, which have a long history of relations. To be even better.
The Acting Head of State emphasized that the Senate, National Assembly, Royal Government, Ministries and National Institutions of the Kingdom of Cambodia are always ready to work closely with the Ambassador to the Kingdom of Cambodia to promote friendly relations and bring cooperation. Huge mutual benefits for both peoples and countries.
Through the Ambassador, the Acting Head of State brought a Royal Message of Remembrance of His Majesty King Norodom Sihamoni, King of the Kingdom of Cambodia, and Queen Norodom Monineath Sihanouk, and the Supreme Leader of the Kingdom of Cambodia. The Kingdom of Cambodia to the President and top leaders of all levels of the Republic of Guatemala.
