(Siem Reap): Siem Reap Provincial Authority together with relevant institutions and national and international partner organizations this morning, September 13, 2022, held a meeting on procedures related to human trafficking and sexual exploitation to strengthen the capacity of Judicial and relevant police officers on the implementation of mechanisms, including the participation of law enforcement to more effectively respond to the best interests of victims of human trafficking.
