(Phnom Penh): The Phnom Penh Capital Administration has decided to set up a commission to study, deal with and reduce flooding in Chbar Ampov district, as this area often suffers from flooding during heavy rains.
In a meeting with Chbar Ampov district authority and relevant departments this morning, September 13, 2022, Mr. Khuong Sreng, Governor of Phnom Penh, introduced a committee with the participation of Khan authorities, relevant departments to study. In this Chbar Ampov area thoroughly.
