Last Saturday, Britain, France and Germany said they were "deeply skeptical" of Iran's intentions after Tehran tried to link the resumption of the nuclear deal with a blockade. The UN investigation into the presence of uranium at its three nuclear sites. Tehran called the European Union statement "unconstitutional."
