(Phnom Penh): Samdech Akka Moha Ponhea Chakrei Heng Samrin, President of the National Assembly of the Kingdom of Cambodia, this morning, September 12, 2022, led a high-level delegation of the National Assembly to pay an official and friendly visit to the Socialist Republic of Vietnam on a special flight.
A high-level delegation from the National Assembly of Cambodia will visit the Socialist Republic of Vietnam from September 12 to 14, 2022. The National Assembly President will hold bilateral talks with National Assembly Chairman Vuong Dinh Hue and pay a courtesy call on top leaders of the Socialist Republic of Vietnam and other parties.
Afterwards, a high-level delegation of the National Assembly led by Samdech Akka Moha Ponhea Chakrei Heng Samrin will continue his official and friendly visit to the Lao People's Democratic Republic from September 14 to 16, 2022.
