The fire broke out in a light storage house in Sen Sok district in the middle of the night, the authorities used almost 60 units of water to completely control
(Phnom Penh): A fire broke out in a house stocking LED lights, destroying all equipment. The above fire occurred at 11:50 pm on September 11, 2022 at the point of house No. 1530 along Trung Moan Street, Trung Moan Village, Sangkat Obek Kam, Khan Sen Sok, Phnom Penh.
Colonel Prohm Yorn, director of the Phnom Penh Municipal Police Fire Prevention and Rescue Office, told Fresh News that after receiving information from residents that a fire was burning in a house, an LED lamp was immediately fired. Also ordered the fire truck of the Phnom Penh Municipal Police at all targets to intervene.
Colonel Prohm Yorn said that in this operation, it was difficult for the specialized force to intervene in time because the location above the entrance was so narrow that it was difficult for fire trucks to intervene and the flames ignited very quickly. A lot. However, professional forces are still trying to intervene to prevent the devil from spreading to other people's homes.
During the operation, the police used several fire trucks, including 18 fire trucks from the Phnom Penh Municipal Office, 54 water trucks, and 1 Cambodian Beer Company truck, which used 2 water trucks to put out the fire. Completely at 01:35 past midnight on September 12.
Lt. Col. Prohm Yorn confirmed that in the case of the above fire, the house, the warehouse, the LED lamp and all the damaged materials with the size (5 meters by 14 meters) were built of concrete. The cause of the fire is being investigated.
After Colonel Prohm Yorn was hired during the operation, officers rescued him from the inside and put him outside and called for an ambulance to take him to the hospital. Today is Ben 2! Discover the history of Pchum Ben and Kan Ben, which are the traditions of the Khmer people
