* Chapter 2: Presentation of achievements, analysis of the overall situation of macroeconomic development and the process of macroeconomic management in the Cambodian economy, highlighting the structure of GDP, fiscal situation and openness of inflation. Economy and trade, trade scales, as well as poverty and employment.
