Chapter 3: is the main chapter of this report, which describes the achievements that the ministries and institutions implement and achieve through activities, programs and projects to implement the priority policies of the Royal Government of Cambodia in the 6th legislature of the National Assembly. From January 2019 to June 2021.
Chapter 5: Establish an estimate of the need for investment resources for the achievement of the goals of the PPA. 2019-2023. The report outlines the resource requirements for the remaining two-and-a-half years (July 2021 to 2023), proposing sources of funding from local and foreign resources, as well as sector capital investment. Public and private.
