(Phnom Penh): Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of the Ministry of Interior, expressed concern over the crime of fraud in the telecommunications system as a group of foreign masterminds took Cambodian territory to commit crimes.
Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng expressed his concern on the occasion that he presided over the inauguration of the 10-storey administrative building and the 3-storey meeting hall of the Phnom Penh Municipal Police this morning. September 8, 2022.
Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng expressed his concern: "Now there is a new crime that has recently appeared in our country. It is not a traditional crime, it is a non-traditional crime, it is a fraud. "The telecommunications system is a problem today."
At the same time, Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng confirmed that for the crime of fraud in the telecommunications system for Phnom Penh, Samdech received only one complaint and sent to the competent experts to monitor to solve this problem.
The Minister of Interior stated, "So, there are a lot of other places, especially in Kampong Som, and the perpetrators of human trafficking through this telecommunications system are taking Cambodia as a crime scene, so Cambodia is a victim place because of the perpetrators. 99.99% of the perpetrators are non-Khmer who are in Cambodia. ”
