Speaking to Fresh News on the afternoon of September 7, 2022, Mr. Hong So Hour, the Royal Government Delegate in charge of the Director General of the Stock Exchange of Cambodia, confirmed that Royal Rail VM is the eighth company to receive Authorized by the Cambodia Securities Exchange to sell bonds.
"After this procedure, the company has to work with the Securities and Exchange Commission of Cambodia and expects that this work will be completed in two months and the bond is scheduled to be issued $ 10 million," said Hong Sohour.
