Chairman of Steung Sen Branch Local Council urges Sangkat Councils to have good internal unity for progress
(Kampong Thom): Mr. Hok Rin, Chairman of the Local Council of Stung Sen Branch, Kampong Thom Province, urged the Sangkat Council to have good internal unity so that the work can progress.
Mr. Hok Rin spoke at the meeting of Stung Sen Branch of Kampong Thom Local Council Association on September 6, 2022 at Stung Sen City Hall with the participation of Mr. Penh Kem, Governor, Mr. Kieng Sengky, Vice President Permanent National Alliance at the local level, members of the Municipal Council and many Sangkat members.
Mr. Kieng Sengky stated that the purpose of establishing this branch is to coordinate various tasks for commune / sangkat councils and to find challenges so that all council associations have the right to express their opinions. Request to the upper level to help solve and be a place to gather information to help develop the capacity of the members of the Council Association.
He said that all commune councils must be united in their work and must strive to study and understand the law on legal documents so that when there is a problem, they answer each other irresponsibly. Yes, and must participate in all activities of the association to participate in capacity development by changing bad attitudes to respond in a timely manner to the needs of the people.
At the same time, Mr. Hok Rin stated that this is a testimony that reflects the correct implementation of the characteristics of the Association, which is a legal entity representing the voice and defender of the interests of all municipal councils and communes in Kampong Thom province. As well as developing capacity and creating effective public services that will contribute to improving the quality of life and well-being of the people through democratic governance at the local level.
Mr. Hok Rin requested the Sangkat Council, Municipal Council to pay the analysis fee for membership to supply back to the Council, to promote the vulnerable group in Sangkat, to clean the environment on the streets and to plant trees. Wood to beautify the city, prevent climate change, help light the streets, public roads need to pay more attention to respond in a timely manner to the needs of the people.
Stopping drugs is a smart choice! Nationwide drug crackdown for September 6: cracked 12 cases, arrested 22 people
(Phnom Penh): The nationwide campaign against illegal drugs for September 6, 2022 showed that law enforcement forces cracked down on 12 cases, including 1 case of use, 7 cases of transport, 1 case of driving under the influence And trafficking in 3 cases, detaining 22 suspects.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen confirmed that there was a cousin named Hun Vibol, but was killed by Pol Pot 44 years ago.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen posted a picture of the scammer and wrote, "To end the fraudulent activities of Hun Vibol, who disguised himself as my cousin, now I would like to confirm that I really have a cousin named Hun Vibol is true, but my brother was killed by Pol Pot 44 years ago.
My nephew introduced Hun Vibol by phone twice, but this person continues to pretend to be my cousin, I refuse to stop, which can lead to the misconception that I am a person who does not care about you.
My compatriots know that I have lived with people in all circumstances and all walks of life without discrimination. In other words, I am a relative, why did I abandon a cousin I miss day and night? Please, Hun Vibol, stop cheating now if you do not want to have a story. Former journalists pay a courtesy call on Minister Khieu Kanharith on his birthday
